        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第九章 无讼 · 第十章 无为政治 笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f7f7f2;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background-color: #fdfdf8;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(160,170,150,0.18) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(160,170,150,0.18) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 22px 22px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 28px 60px 40px 34px;\n  }\n  /* binding holes on the right edge */\n  .holes {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 55px;\n    right: 8px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 560px;\n  }\n  .holes span {\n    display: block;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 21px;\n    border: 1px solid #cfcfc4;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f2f2ec;\n  }\n  .note-label {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #6a6a6a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .top-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 40px;\n    left: 34px;\n  }\n  .chapter {\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 34px;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .chapter .hl {\n    background: rgba(255, 235, 60, 0.55);\n  }\n  .item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 30px;\n  }\n  .marker {\n    flex: 0 0 26px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #1a1a3a;\n    background: rgba(255, 235, 60, 0.5);\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .marker.plain {\n    background: none;\n  }\n  .body {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.95;\n    color: #14142b;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: rgba(255, 235, 60, 0.55);\n  }\n  .sub-head {\n    margin: 12px 0 6px 8px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #14142b;\n  }\n  .superscript {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-right: 40px;\n    color: #14142b;\n  }\n  .footer-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 22px;\n    left: 34px;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 20px;\n    right: 34px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,150,60,0.5);\n  }\n  .rule.bottom { bottom: 48px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"holes\">\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-label top-label\">备注：</div>\n\n  <div class=\"chapter\"><span class=\"hl\">第九章 · 无讼</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"marker\">一</div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      “讼师”向“律师”的那种改变，意味着<span class=\"hl\">礼治社会向法</span><br>\n      治社会的转变。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"marker\">二</div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      当社会结构和思想观念未能适应法治的时候，贸然<br>\n      推行法治下乡，一方面会破坏原有的礼治秩序，另一方<br>\n      面还不能建立起有效的法治秩序，使人们对于法治<br>\n      产生抵触。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"chapter\" style=\"margin-top:22px;\"><span class=\"hl\">第十章 · 无为政治</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"superscript\">长期</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n    <div class=\"marker\">一</div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      皇权受<span class=\"hl\">横暴权力</span>收受到小农经济的限制，无法进行大规<br>\n      模工程，所以会采用“无为”的方式来养民”\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-head\">二、研究权力还要从两方面着眼</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"marker\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <span class=\"hl\">社会冲突</span> ⇒ <span class=\"hl\">横暴权力</span>：在上下有剥削和权力的统治下，人们达到了休战<br>\n      或状态中的一时平衡，但这不是冲突的消弭。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"marker\">2</div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <span class=\"hl\">社会合作</span> ⇒ <span class=\"hl\">同意权力</span>：每个人为了维持自己的生存状态，不得不做好<br>\n      自己的分内工作，同时要求别人做好他们的分内工作，这<br>\n      就产生了权利和义务。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule bottom\"></div>\n  <div class=\"note-label footer-label\">总结：</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
